<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Enough is Enough, 2018</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=5 face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;IMG alt=http://www.plafactory.com/shopimages/plafactory/002002001404.jpg align=middle src="http://www.plafactory.com/shopimages/plafactory/002002001404.jpg"&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT color=white face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;The F2 will play a key role in the battle. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=5 face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Enough is a Enough: Byte Battle for Command&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Berlin Sans FB Demi',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location: &lt;/STRONG&gt;Kuril Islands (Disputed)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Berlin Sans FB Demi',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;May/June 2018&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Berlin Sans FB Demi',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;Japan (elements of the JSDF)&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Berlin Sans FB Demi',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Note:&lt;/STRONG&gt; Only the Base Game is required&lt;/FONT&gt;.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Berlin Sans FB Demi',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Berlin Sans FB Demi',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Description: &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Japan and Russia&amp;nbsp;never signed a peace agreement to end World War II disputing which nation is the true owner of four islands north of Japan’s Hokkaido Island – the Kurils. &lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Soviet forces took the islands in the closing days of the war shortly before Japan’s surrender. The Russian government recently approved a plan to militarize an airfield on one of the four islands allowing their armed forces&amp;nbsp;to use the old civilian strip. The Russia’s have already sent anti-ship and SAMs to the islands and Moscow ultimately plans to build a naval base on the Island chain. Russia’s Prime Minister Dmitry Medvedev approved the deployment of Russian warplanes to the island on February 2, 2018. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=4 face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Russia also announced plans to station unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) on the islands as well to upgrading the island’s defences that includes assigning a tank battalion on a permanent basis, positioning Pantsir, Tor, and Buk mobile defense systems, while providing infrastructure for the S-400 system to be deployed there in times of crisis.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=4 face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Overnight, US intelligence informed Japan that elements of an S-400 Division were in route to the islands via Vladivostok. It is not clear if this is by water or air. But what is clear is that Japan’s Defense minister, Itsunori Onodera,&lt;STRONG&gt; &lt;/STRONG&gt;called Washington and said “Enough is Enough”. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;In direct violation of the Japanese Constitution, Japan will conduct its first offensive action since WWII. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;Kevin M Kinscherf w/ many thanks to&amp;nbsp;RWReese&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=4 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=4 face=Arial&gt;Avoid spoilers: Please send feedback to &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;A href="mailto:kevinkin@comcast.net"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=4 face=Arial&gt;kevinkin@comcast.net&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=white size=4 face=Arial&gt;. Thanks.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ffffff size=4 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ffffff size=4 face=Arial&gt;&lt;IMG alt=http://newslanc.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/russojapan01.jpg src="http://newslanc.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/russojapan01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ffffff size=4 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ffffff face=Arial&gt;Area of Operations &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;
